  "body_html": "<h1>VCG Truthfulness And Individual Rationality</h1>\n<p>Under the stated nonnegativity hypotheses, the VCG mechanism gives\nnonnegative truthful quasi-linear utility, is ex-post individually rational,\nand is dominant-strategy incentive compatible.</p>",
